<title>SINGAPORE: Promet extends IPCO takeover.</title>
<headline>Promet extends IPCO takeover.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Promet Bhd said on Thursday it had extended its takeover offer of IPCO International Ltd by one day to January 3, 1997.</p>
<p>A statement issued by its subsidiary and takeover vehicle, Oradea Pte Ltd, said this was because the original closing date for the takeover acceptance had been declared the polling day for Singapore's general elections and a public holiday.</p>
<p>Oradea is acquiring 11.73 million ordinary shares of Singapore $1.70 each in IPCO.</p>
<p>It said the offer would remain open for acceptance until 0730 GMT on January 3.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
